      "instance_name": "dancing_man_scene",
      "label": "man_dancing_in_a_celebration",
      "description": "A man in traditional Jewish attire (black coat, fur hat) is energetically dancing or gesturing with arms outstretched in the center of a room filled with seated men in similar attire. The scene takes place at a long table covered with plastic, suggesting a festive Jewish gathering like a wedding or meal. The text overlay 'when the bass drops just right' implies the man's exaggerated reaction to music. The spatial arrangement shows the dancing man as the focal point, with other participants seated around him, observing or participating in the event.",
