      "instance_name": "Jewish_wedding_celebration",
      "label": "Jewish wedding celebration",
      "description": "The scene depicts a traditional Jewish celebration, likely a wedding or festive meal (seudah), where dancing and music are common. The attire (black coat, fur hat, long beard) and setting (long tables covered with plastic, seated guests) are typical of such events. Understanding this cultural context is necessary to interpret the man's behavior as part of a joyful, communal celebration rather than an unrelated or inappropriate act.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
